":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"未由相邻段落推算纪年；原文时间表达保留在来源引句中。","evidence":["santizhu064-q-01ac35039ef61997580b"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu064-q-01ac35039ef61997580b","source_order":[64,85,27],"order":11009}],"persons":[{"id":"santizhu-p0151","name":"华融","evidence":["santizhu064-q-d291c494e8c9a9a2091f","santizhu064-q-01ac35039ef61997580b","santizhu064-q-442ad62ad9b020261cfb"],"facts":[{"id":"santizhu064-f-sr-027","text":"字德蕤，广陵江都人；祖父避乱居山阴蕊山下；张温就皇象学舍融家，温为选部尚书擢融为太子庶子，遂知名显达；子谞黄门郎与融并见害，次子谭以才辩称、晋秘书监","evidence":["santizhu064-q-442ad62ad9b020261cfb"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"santizhu064-q-01ac35039ef61997580b","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-abcd4067dd800ab40ef9","layer":"original","quote":"胤又劫融等，使诈〔为〕诏发兵。融等不从，胤皆杀之。﹝一﹞胤颜色不变，谈笑若常","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":417,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":27,"end":65,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu064-q-442ad62ad9b020261cfb","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-450c7deb1ecbe6da8184","layer":"pei","quote":"《文士传》曰：“华融字德蕤，广陵江都人。祖父避乱，居山阴蕊山下。时，皇象亦寓居山阴。吴郡张温来就象学，欲得所舍。或告温曰：‘蕊山下有华德蕤者，虽年少，美有令志，可舍也。’温遂止融家，朝夕谈讲。俄而温为选部尚书，乃擢融为太子庶子，遂知名显达。融子谞，黄门郎，与融并见害；次子谭，以才辩称，晋秘书监。”","attribution":"裴注·文士传","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":437,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-dfb14e07a66a52ecdbbf","start":3,"end":152,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu064-q-d291c494e8c9a9a2091f","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-da2900eb25692ecb6e49","layer":"original","quote":"据引兵还，使人报胤，欲共废綝。綝闻之，遣从兄（虑）〔宪〕，将兵逆据于江都〖3〗；使中使敕文钦、刘纂、唐咨等，合众击据；遣侍中、左将军华融、中书丞丁晏，告胤取据，并喻胤宜速去意〖4〗。胤自以祸及，因留融、晏，勒兵自卫","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":416,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":47,"end":154,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
